.TH "4ksdemo-by-madmartigan" "6" "2026-11-13" "4ks demo User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
4ksdemo-by-madmartigan - 4k intro by MadMartigan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
4ksdemo-by-madmartigan
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
4ks demo is a 4k intro written in C++ with SDL and OpenGL by MadMartigan
(Vincent Siles), released in 2004 for the #demoscene 4k source compo,
where it ranked 7th with 22 points.
.PP
The intro runs in a 640x480 window.
Its animation is frame based: the Debian package limits it to 60 frames
per second so that it keeps the speed it had on the hardware of 2004.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]Escape\f[R]
The scenes do not change automatically: press Escape to switch to the
next scene.
On the last scene (\[lq]END\[rq]), Escape quits the intro.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
